#. i18n: file: platform.ui:47
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, optNative)
#: rc.cpp:15
msgctxt "radio button to choose Windows Desktop shell"
msgid "Native desktop shell"
msgstr "សែល​ផ្ទៃតុ​សកម្ម"

